		"1.5.0": " Ported to 1.18.  Performance increase: ItemStacks are no longer repeatedly copied while doing sorting/imports/exports, reducing RAM use/CPU load.  Cables can all be now water-loggable. Storage Request Table now correctly drops items from crafting grid when broken.",
